{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1071490/extras/1369ecd3219f1a0f647423d91f3325b9.avif?t=1749284500\" width=634 height=356 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After being classified as a demon by the church, Lisette Blanchard is abducted by a mysterious group of thieves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Believing the abduction was a ploy to hide Lisette, the church executes the head of the Blanchard family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In response, the family's maid, Forty, a retired assassin, once again takes up her blade in order to rescue Lisette, and prove her innocence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic RPG experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak your way past enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed up battles</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1071490?t=1749284500","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1071490/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749284500","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1071490/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749284500","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1071490/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749284500","categories":[{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Miss Lisette's Assassin Maid contains strong language and partial nudity."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.aka